{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_039_01_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:c2908f07175141a357f9c1f7e12f7d56b54dfcf76e2a9894ee561d2bdc189113",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_b:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d64cd243ba82653f354e9a8b7413eae5757840993898ecfef946be75ddd7fe94",
      "text": "（……哈啊。\n今天也没找到有力的线索吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_b:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5f392824f49861d6766ceae7a1725d530af6f890f620086d5d3715139985677",
      "text": "（虽然很着急，但现在能做的，\n也就只有贴寻物启事和打听情况这种踏踏实实的活动了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_b:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c2dab891ff6cabb2acef55724288be647d8b3dd24ed7daf5b179140d8e18d0c",
      "text": "（不能急躁，只能继续做现在能做的事。\n……话虽如此，压缩睡眠时间也是有极限的啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_b:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4868b8c7ffe6daa17755d27fc8a5c497729435c3449a85cfa6676bfc7649823",
      "text": "……道流先生？\n您托我找的资料，我放在这里了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_b:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8a91082047995d4f4f3c3a805b2d9b97840aae6045914202822ff7c5bf0a4d5",
      "text": "……！不好意思，●●●●●●●●●●师父！\n我刚才走神了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_b:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af4b2fe485d0a1257041957098905712229001e30d0f6df96e3590f1fe86f32e",
      "text": "道流先生。\n最近发生什么事了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_b:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:572407af343d255ecfbaa85e20ccccdc094102662aa4391786331ca87c8576e2",
      "text": "休息时间看起来也忙忙碌碌的，\n好像有点疲惫的样子……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_b:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6210fe76dee0ce3b769e941a951a16d2f1f52ed66968eabff4d1464c29191b95",
      "text": "啊——……●●●●●●●●●●师父还真是\n什么都瞒不过你的法眼啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_b:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8684d529769e8342dfe2065331b8c8d4c1210ad97dee11c7780b8afaf2068cbc",
      "text": "可以的话，能跟我聊聊吗？\n说不定我能帮上什么忙。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_b:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd37142a873e9f6bc8b6230ce9b498cc158ccdfbf237b614049593b5e5f55475",
      "text": "……也是呢。也不能总让●●●●●●●●●●师父\n一直替我担心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_b:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47a425e251f0bd4249f5a9615c9e205c7a46af098b255edbd6030081c7166e81",
      "text": "其实，从前一阵子开始，\n我就在找一只走失的小鸟。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
